{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_seed_provider", "label": "Seed provider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "rationale": "Beantwortet 'welche Adressen soll ich beim Join als Seeds probieren' \u2014 einmal beim Node-Start. Getrennt vom Receptionist, obwohl beide 'Discovery' heissen: beide sind lookup-basierte Adressierung, aber Protokolle und Anwendungsfaelle unterscheiden sich.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_receptionist", "label": "Receptionist (Runtime-Service-Lookup)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "rationale": "Beantwortet 'welche Actors sind clusterweit unter diesem Service-Key registriert' \u2014 waehrend des Betriebs. Seed provider laufen einmal, der Receptionist laeuft kontinuierlich.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_one_lookup_is_not_an_answer", "label": "One lookup is not an answer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "rationale": "Ein Provider liefert nur, was er JETZT sieht. Beim gleichzeitigen Start ist das auf jedem Node eine andere Menge \u2014 DNS mitten in der Propagation, ein Pod Ready bevor seine IP publiziert ist, eine paginierte K8s-Teilliste \u2014 und ein Node, der auf die erste Antwort joint, formt einen Cluster aus seiner eigenen Teilsicht.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_cluster_bootstrap", "label": "Cluster bootstrap (stabile Beobachtung)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "rationale": "Wickelt jeden Provider ein: pollt, bis die zurueckgegebene Menge stabil ist, und laesst dann genau einen Node den Cluster formen. Die Provider bleiben unveraendert \u2014 Bootstrap ist eine Phase obendrauf, kein Ersatz.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_discovery_is_cluster_internal", "label": "Discovery ist fuer Cluster-Internas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "rationale": "Externe Service-Discovery (Consul, Eureka, Service Meshes) ist Sache der Infrastruktur; actor-ts bezieht daraus beim Start seine Peer-Adressen und nimmt sonst nicht daran teil. K8s-Service-Routing und Mesh-Proxies sind ausdruecklich nicht dieses Werkzeug.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_seed_provider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_receptionist", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_one_lookup_is_not_an_answer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_seed_provider", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_one_lookup_is_not_an_answer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_cluster_bootstrap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_overview_cluster_bootstrap", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discov